    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I probably won't be found if I hide here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I won't be able to go back to those kids anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope nothing happens to them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*... Why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you Miss Misha?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Miss Misha. I hope I didn't scare you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are my coleagues, Franka and Liskarm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're from Rhodes Island Pharmaceuticals. As an organization made to serve the Infected, at least...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We hope to be able to help you. That's why we'd like to talk for a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Talk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't the best place for that though...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "As of right now, our top priority is keeping you safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the time being, we'll protect you, so rest assured.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What... are you talking about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just going to capture me and lock me up, aren't you? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get away from me! My claws are sharp...! If you don't want to get hurt...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Pfft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you laughing about...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If we really were going to capture you, we wouldn't have given you a chance to resist.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Misha, we really do want to help you, so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't trust you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen treats the Infected worse than they treat criminals!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would you... Why would you go out of your way to help the Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "--Miss Misha, look...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What... are you doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Your...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your hand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're also... an Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, I'm just like you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There are a lot of Infected in these slums. Those kids you left behind just now... they trusted you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Misha, you've already put them in danger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you going to use those kids to threaten me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I wouldn't. But someone has already started doing exactly that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We just chased off a group of thugs that was trying to threaten those kids.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen is also currently searching for the Infected. If Lungmen found you first, it might've already been too late.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We wanted to divert the rioters from those kids by drawing their attention to you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looking at it from another perspective, we'd also be able to keep you safe from harm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Do you know why they're after me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "What reason do you have... to do all this for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We actually don't know why there are Infected targeting you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we do care about the safety of innocents, including you. At least, this is the best course of action for the time being. I hope that you'll be able to trust us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you allow us to take you from here first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fine... Let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, I don't really have a choice, do I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't say that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least, thank you... Miss Misha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
